  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Arrange the four graphs in descending order of total work done; where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are the work done corresponding to figure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math> respectively.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/dd6c1e60-b6b0-4ca7-b87c-630d5cc81c08-image.png\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 139px;\" /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/27af9f55-ddf3-4d4a-a28e-fd5eac77a97b-image.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 136px;\" /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/08d1cdbc-29eb-4f38-9193-ab439a9b68b6-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 131px;\" /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a34aed01-eb8d-4b85-bdff-95407cf42e72-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 127px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
